      <pattern name="To parsing" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Signals/Actions/DecisionActionExecutors.cs">BudgetInquiryActionExecutor.Map :1543-1555: split, de-dup, Address regex, refusal before any write. Copy for cc/bcc.</pattern>
